# Run — 2026-10-20 — atl-manager runtime (Benny-style team runner)

## Task
Implement the persistent coordinator runtime for the named digital team (Mira, Pip, Rowan, Sage, Beacon): one state store, one coordinator loop, two+ worker roles as contracts, intake adapters, isolated workspaces, review gate, manager brief, and flow diagrams.

## Route rationale
The team policy layer already existed (skills/atl-team, config/model-routing.json). What was missing was the runtime that keeps roles alive across sessions. Built as a zero-dependency Node CLI so it runs on the user's Windows shell without installs.

