## What to reuse or change next time
- cmd.exe mangles multi-line `node -e` — use the Edit tool or single-line scripts.
- Edge headless needs an isolated `--user-data-dir` when a desktop Edge instance is running.
- Edge headless `--dump-dom` clamps the window to ~477px regardless of `--window-size`; screenshots honor it. For true phone-width layout evidence, render the page inside a 390px iframe and post measurements to the parent title (`--allow-file-access-from-files --virtual-time-budget`), then read `<title>` from the dump.
- When the first real Azure PAT arrives, run `intake --source azure` and record triage decisions back into this file chain.

